        <article><header><small>{probe.status}</small><strong>{probe.fortune}</strong><b>{probe.hexagram}{probe.line}</b></header><div><span>周期位置<b>{probe.cycle_position}</b></span><i>→</i><span>入卦<b>第{probe.hexagram_year}年</b></span><i>→</i><span>入爻<b>第{probe.line_year}年</b></span><i>·</i><span>爻策<b>{probe.line_weight}年</b></span></div></article>
