      <article><header><small>{position.type}</small><strong>{position.position}</strong><b>→ {position.palace}宫</b></header><div><span>同组位置</span><strong>{position.paired_with}</strong><small>{palace.pair_label}</small></div><section><span>固定例对象</span>{position.fixed_objects.length > 0 ? <p>{position.fixed_objects.join(' · ')}</p> : <p>本固定例没有对象落在这里</p>}</section></article>
